Unseen-Attack Detection in the Internet of Medical Things -- Third-party notices
============================================================================

Dataset
-------
CICIoMT2024 is provided by the Canadian Institute for Cybersecurity (CIC).
See https://www.unb.ca/cic/datasets/iomt-dataset-2024.html and the dataset paper (Internet of Things 28, 101351, DOI 10.1016/j.iot.2024.101351). The raw data are not redistributed.

Dependencies
------------
This software uses PyTorch, scikit-learn, NumPy, pandas, SciPy, and
Matplotlib. Each package carries its own licence.
See requirements.txt for the exact versions used.
